# Accessibility & Lighthouse (portfolio)

Barrierefreiheit ist Produktfokus (BFSG / WCAG). Bei A11y-Fragen, Releases mit UI-Impact oder „check the site“: **messen, nicht raten**.

## Tools

Use Chrome DevTools MCP (`plugin-devtools-for-agents-chrome-devtools`) when available:

1. `navigate_page` / `new_page` → target URL
2. `lighthouse_audit` with `mode: "navigation"`, `device: "desktop"` and/or `"mobile"`, `outputDirPath` under `.a11y-reports/<page-slug>/`
3. `evaluate_script` for heading outline, landmarks, orphan inputs, tap sizes (see a11y-debugging skill snippets)
4. `list_console_messages` with `types: ["issue"]`, `includePreservedMessages: true`

Also follow the **a11y-debugging** skill (web.dev guidelines) when present.

